<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <span style="font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold;">USF</span>
    <div style="font-size: 24px; margin-top: -10px;">UNIVERSITY OF SOUTH FLORIDA.</div>
  </div>

  <p>Date: <span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span></p>

  <p>To Certifying Official of University of South Florida:</p>

  <p>Student: <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></p>
  <p>SSN #: XXX-XX-<span data-field="ssn_last_four">{{ ssn_last_four }}</span></p>

  <p>This letter is to confirm the courses that <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span> is enrolled for the <span data-field="semester">{{ semester }}</span> semester is applicable to his/her degree program.</p>
  <p>is pursuing a <span data-field="degree_program">{{ degree_program }}</span>.</p>
  <p>The following course(s) for which the student has registered is applicable to the degree plan:</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Course Number</th>
        <th>Course Name</th>
        <th>Number of Credits</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in course_registrations %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="course_registrations[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_number">{{ item.course_number }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_registrations[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_name">{{ item.course_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_registrations[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ item.credits }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>Respectfully,</p>

  <div style="height: 80px; margin-top: 50px;"></div>

  <p>Title: <span data-field="title">{{ title }}</span></p>
  <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
  <p>Email: <span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></p>

  <div style="margin-top: 100px; text-align: center;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Office of Veteran Success</p>
    <p>• University of South Florida • <span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span> • <span data-field="city_state_zip">{{ city_state_zip }}</span> •</p>
    <p>• Phone: <span data-field="office_phone">{{ office_phone }}</span> • Fax: <span data-field="office_fax">{{ office_fax }}</span> •</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <span style="font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold;">USF</span>
    <div style="font-size: 24px; margin-top: -10px;">UNIVERSITY OF SOUTH FLORIDA.</div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">Instructions</h2>

  <ol>
    <li>Fill out this form with your name, U#, degree program, and courses that you are enrolled in.</li>
    <li>Take this form to your academic advisor to have your courses confirmed and this form signed.</li>
  </ol>
</div>